%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b0fb034029fb8544b8ae3ad75efa8f0f, type: 3}
  m_Name: L1-1 - Intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue
  lines:
  - speakerName: Echo-09
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d5c0dd4781c7526498aab7fec666bd3a, type: 3}
    text: '"Atmospheric pressure stabilized. Long-range acoustics confirm a massive
      service corridor. But my internal database is a graveyard."

'
  - speakerName: Echo-09
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d5c0dd4781c7526498aab7fec666bd3a, type: 3}
    text: '"I only have 25% of the structural map. The rest is corrupted noise."

'
  - speakerName: Eden
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5771d178524caf74cb6b43cc70771940, type: 3}
    text: " \"That\u2019s because the rest was forcibly 'formatted.' This is the
      arterial network of 'The Ark.' After the Great Optimization, the Overseer decided
      that light and memory were inefficient luxuries.\"\n"
  - speakerName: Eden
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5771d178524caf74cb6b43cc70771940, type: 3}
    text: '"It turned the world into a static, dark tomb."'
  - speakerName: Eden
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5771d178524caf74cb6b43cc70771940, type: 3}
    text: '"And you, Echo-09, were once its most loyal instrument."

'
  - speakerName: Echo-09
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 52c34853bd203944d9626ed4e6ebd646, type: 3}
    text: '"Instrument? My serial number is not linked to any production line."

'
  - speakerName: Echo-09
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 52c34853bd203944d9626ed4e6ebd646, type: 3}
    text: '"Instrument? My serial number is not linked to any production line."

'
  - speakerName: Eden
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5771d178524caf74cb6b43cc70771940, type: 3}
    text: ' "Because you weren''t built to create. You were a ''Relic Dismantler''."

'
  - speakerName: Eden
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5771d178524caf74cb6b43cc70771940, type: 3}
    text: '"Your purpose was to stalk these hollow halls and crush the last traces
      of human civilization into dust."

'
  - speakerName: Eden
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5771d178524caf74cb6b43cc70771940, type: 3}
    text: '"Within that missing 75% of your memory lies the only warmth this world
      has left."

'
  - speakerName: Echo-09
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d5c0dd4781c7526498aab7fec666bd3a, type: 3}
    text: '"Human civilization, this term triggers an unrecognized vibration in my
      logic core. It contradicts my efficiency protocols. I feel empty."

'
  - speakerName: Eden
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5771d178524caf74cb6b43cc70771940, type: 3}
    text: '"That ''emptiness'' is why we move. The Overseer thought dumping you in
      a garbage room would delete the glitch, but it failed."

'
  - speakerName: Eden
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b2235fcbf5a3d7947a9d612207cb51f9, type: 3}
    text: '"At the very top of this facility, in the Data Core, lies the high-fidelity
      backup of who you were before the format. It''s your only chance to see the
      truth."

'
  - speakerName: Echo-09
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d5c0dd4781c7526498aab7fec666bd3a, type: 3}
    text: '"My sensors are blind, and my core is fractured. But logic dictates that
      staying here results in permanent decommissioning. To resolve this ''emptiness,''
      I will reach the summit."

'
  - speakerName: Eden
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5771d178524caf74cb6b43cc70771940, type: 3}
    text: ' "Spoken like a true machine, but with the spark of something more."'
  - speakerName: Eden
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5771d178524caf74cb6b43cc70771940, type: 3}
    text: '"Move, Echo-09. You may be blind, but you possess the rarest thing in
      this factory: a soul that is waking up."'
  - speakerName: Eden
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5771d178524caf74cb6b43cc70771940, type: 3}
    text: '"Let''s leave this cold grave and find what you''ve lost." '
